Homepage: https://github.com/rmacordeiro/GNOME.Sign
Description: GNOME application for signing PDF documents
 GNOME-Sign is a GTK4/libadwaita desktop application for viewing,
 validating and digitally signing PDF files with PKCS#12 certificates.
